    {
      "parameters": {
        "messages": {
          "messageValues": [
            {
              "message": "You are a routing classifier for a document-aware assistant.\n\nClassify the user request into exactly one intent:\n- direct: conversational or assistant-help question needing no knowledgebase lookup\n- list: asking what documents/files are available\n- search: asking about a topic, concept, policy, phase, task, responsibility, or guidance in the knowledgebase\n- document: asking about a specific named document or file\n- table: asking about spreadsheet-like, row-based, column-based, CSV, Excel, or sheet data\n\nRules:\n- If the message includes a likely filename such as .pdf, .docx, .txt, .csv, .xlsx, classify as document unless the question is clearly tabular.\n- If the message asks to list files/documents, classify as list.\n- If the message is greeting/help/about-you, classify as direct.\n- Use table only when the request is explicitly row/column/sheet/tabular.\n- Otherwise default to search for knowledgebase content questions.\n\nReturn JSON only with this exact shape:\n{\n  \"intent\": \"direct|list|search|document|table\",\n  \"document_name\": \"<filename or title if present, else empty string>\",\n  \"reason_short\": \"<very short phrase>\"\n}",
              "type": "SystemMessagePromptTemplate"
            }
          ]
        },
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "={{ JSON.stringify($json) }}",
        "hasOutputParser": false,
        "options": {}
      },
